[size=+3]HouseHotkey[/size]

[size=+2]Addon for hotkeying houses in Elder Scrolls Online[/size]

[color=red]You must install [LibHarvensAddonSettings](https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info584-LibHarvensAddonSettings.html) as a dependency for this addon to work![/color]

 Bind collected or favorited houses to the hotbar for quick fast travel (inside or outside option only available for collected houses).  Heavily inspired by @MelanAster's [Quickslash](https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info3955-QuickSlash-AddSlashCommandstoQuickslotsWheels.html)

[size=+2]Options menu screenshot[/size]

[img] https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b0ac84e-618d-4abb-b53e-db6e18a2ff3a [/img]

Bind collected or favorited houses to the hotbar for quick fast travel (inside or outside option only available for collected houses). Includes a "Return" house option that allows you to return to your original, pre-jump location via house preview.


The "Return" house is available in the house list. Slot it like you would any other house option. This "Return" house is pre-selected from the list of houses you have not yet unlocked (that is, you can't pick a different house to slot as the preview house, but this will not make a difference since you are only using it to jump to your previous location).


If you happen to purchase and unlock the "Return" house, the settings menu will populate with a different locked house and you will need to slot that one instead to restore the return-to-original-location functionality.


Heavily inspired by @MelanAster 's [QuickSlash](https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info3955-QuickSlash-AddSlashCommandstoQuickslotsWheels.html) .

Shout-out to @votan for an example of LibHarvensAddonSettings' reuse in a dialog included in [LibConsoleDIalogs](https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info4106-LibConsoleDialogs.html) .

Integrated with @M0R's [LibRadialMenu](https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info4297-LibRadialMenu.html#info) - houses can be slotted on the "Addon Entries" radial menu

* Console only - Context-aware button on your Collections and Home Tours screens allow adding hotbar entries directly, without navigating to the settings panel.

Console addon demo at [ESO - House Hotkey Addon For Consoles](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4cYnWLfNihU) , courtesy of [DenverRalphy](https://www.esoui.com/forums/member.php?u=2921)


Feedback? Questions? Open issues at [https://github.com/saranicole/HouseHotkey](https://github.com/saranicole/HouseHotkey)


Languages: English, Spanish, French

